SYNOPSIS:
        int set_heart_beat(int flag)

DESCRIPTION:
        Enable or disable heart beat. The gamedriver will call every 2
        seconds the lfun heart_beat() of the current object if it is
        enabled. If the heart beat is not needed for the moment, then
        do disable it. This will reduce system overhead.
        
        Return true for success, and false for failure. Specifically,
        it will fail if the heart beat function has been disabled,
        which it will be if there is a run time error in it.

SEE ALSO:
        heart_beat(L), call_out(E)
